{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "parent-help",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -245,
      "width": 2700,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "# Settlements · Rule parents\n\nOne card per Family → Type / Parent. Double-click a card to open its live rule list. Change Type / Parent in the Complete Index’s **Editable index** table to reassign a rule. These parent cards are navigation; dragging them does not reassign rules or edit the manuscript. Deferred rules retain their Status. Use Canvas: Jump to group to find a family."
    },
